      <tei:div type="introduction">
        <tei:p>This is a Ḥanukkah piyyut by R. Salomon Berdugo (1854–1906), illustrious payṭan and the chief rabbi of Meknes, Morocco. According to the Kehillot Sharot organization’s notes, found here, “This piyyut speaks of the miracles that occured for the Hasmoneans, both in war against the Greeks and in purification of the Temple. It is customarily sung in Maqam Hijaz.”</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_64990_introduction"/>
      <j:conditional xml:id="osp_64990_notes">
